Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:07.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the time between winter and summer,\Nthe number of residents increased again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.75,0:00:12.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After discussing it with everyone, we decided\Nto call this place The Great Tree Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:17.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I ended becoming\Nthe mayor of this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:19.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even though I'm the mayor now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.63,0:00:22.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,my day-to-day routine\Nhasn't really changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:30.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A messenger from the Demonic Kingdom has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.67,0:00:32.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A messenger from the Demonic Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.58,0:00:52.17,Song,,0,0,0,,When you open your eyes and see\Nthat pure white light, the story begins
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:58.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Stepping forth into a new world,\Nwhat kind of flowers will we make bloom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:06.50,Song,,0,0,0,,Even if it's cloudy,\Neven if we get dirty from a puddle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:09.33,Song,,0,0,0,,We continue on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.33,0:01:16.08,Song,,0,0,0,,There's a future we can't imagine\Nwaiting for us, I'm sure of it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:19.96,Song,,0,0,0,,Meeting, meeting, and connecting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:23.25,Song,,0,0,0,,If you smile,\Neveryone around you will smile too
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.25,0:01:27.29,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's plant a small seed and nurture it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.29,0:01:31.38,Song,,0,0,0,,One day it'll become a large flower
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:34.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Turn regrets and failures into fuel
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.88,0:01:38.17,Song,,0,0,0,,So that you're overflowing with colorful happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:42.38,Song,,0,0,0,,We'll join hands and share
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:48.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Spread across the world, Flower Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.67,0:02:09.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My name is Beezel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like to have an audience with\Nthe person in charge here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's my first job as the mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.75,0:02:18.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.29,0:02:21.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm the mayor, Hiraku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.38,0:02:23.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.75,0:02:25.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In commemoration of\Nour becoming acquainted...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.42,0:02:30.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please accept this gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:33.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:36.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a message from the demon lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:39.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He would like to discuss\Nthe status of this settlement here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:44.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think anyone owns\Nthis particular plot of land or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:46.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I guess technically it's under\Nthe control of the demon lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:50.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does he want me to pay taxes...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:53.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,for all the time I've spent living on his land?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No wait, maybe he's going to tell me\Nto get off his property?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:02:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe it would be wise for me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.25,0:03:02.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to ask Lu and Tia for their advice\Nbefore I do anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:09.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright, it's time for me to step up\Nand handle my duties as mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:13.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If the demon lord is willing to\Naccept us living here on this land,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then I would be willing to offer part of\Nour harvest as payment of taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:22.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First, I need to show that I have no intention\Nof rebelling against the demon lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.29,0:03:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As for the rate we pay...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:26.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to be strong for this part!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:27.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...how does 10% sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was that too low?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:33.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well then!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.29,0:03:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you satisfied with this arrangement?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.00,0:03:36.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.29,0:03:38.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.75,0:03:41.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like you guys to come pick it up\Nevery year before winter starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.54,0:03:44.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's how we'll proceed from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.33,0:03:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is it settled already?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The tax we pay will be 10%\Nof our total harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:04:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, this is limited to\Nwhat we grow in our fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.75,0:04:04.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We won't give them any of the milk, eggs,\Nhoney or alcohol that we produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:07.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If the demon lord's people are\Ninterested in anything else we produce,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:08.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then we'll enter trade negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:13.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did end up feeling like I was\Ntoo aggressive with my negotiations...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I bid you all farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.75,0:04:17.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...so I sent him home with a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:22.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope I handled that all the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:25.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think you did a pretty good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:27.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Since we're paying them taxes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we're technically under\Ntheir protection from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:32.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But still... 10%?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:39.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Usually the going rate is\Nsupposed to be 50 or 60%.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:40.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:44.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Having them come here to collect the\Npayment every year was a good decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:48.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It forces them to officially\Nrecognize our residence here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:50.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And if they're only coming\Nto collect once a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.88,0:04:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they won't be able to accurately\Nmeasure everything we produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In other words, we just bought\Nthe protection of the demon lord
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.63,0:04:59.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,for a real tax rate of under 10%!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:00.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well done, mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:01.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,R-really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.92,0:05:04.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And to top it off, they brought this present.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.58,0:05:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The almighty medicine that works if you\Ndrink it or apply it directly to an injury!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.13,0:05:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:13.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're submitting to our military force?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.83,0:05:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.71,0:05:18.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even though they have the strength\Nto defeat a wyvern...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Surely, they must have some ulterior motive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.83,0:05:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had the same suspicion,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:25.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I had no choice but to accept their conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:26.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.25,0:05:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The vampire princess and\Nthe angel of annihilation were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.25,0:05:30.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:35.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The great sage Lulucy and\Nthe strongest of all the angels?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:36.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:38.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:42.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was an army of high elves\Nand a pack of inferno wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:43.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the group that guided me to the leader\Nwas the trio of killer angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:50.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought my life was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:55.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then I can see how they\Nwere able to take down a wyvern.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.17,0:06:00.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all that, he suggested that they be\Nunder the protection of the demon lord's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I couldn't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.88,0:06:05.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I had, they would have immediately\Nbecome an enemy force.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The silver lining in all of this is that\Nwe were able to negotiate amicably.\N{\rSubtitle-2}No way... this can't be happening...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They even gave me a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:15.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.63,0:06:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I haven't looked yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:17.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to consult the demon lord first.\N{\rSubtitle-2}It's over... we're finished...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:20.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And what if it's something dangerous?\N{\rSubtitle-2}It's over... we're finished...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.21,0:06:28.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They look kind of like appos,\Nbut the shape and color are much nicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.71,0:06:30.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Better check if they're poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.33,0:06:32.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.25,0:06:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is really good! It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:37.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't just eat those!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This cloth... it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.71,0:06:44.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this from a demon spider?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:46.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, a great demon spider?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:51.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Didn't one of those fight one of\Nthe previous demon lords to a standstill?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:53.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They have one of those, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.67,0:06:54.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm resigning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.71,0:06:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Randan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Randan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.46,0:07:06.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My name is Dryme.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.50,0:07:09.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am the one true ruler of the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:16.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is a present from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.04,0:07:17.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:19.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:20.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:24.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks really expensive,\Nbut this seems like kind of a violent gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:27.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-thank you for the wonderful gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.88,0:07:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's our pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.46,0:07:32.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, what's the purpose of\Nyour visit here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.58,0:07:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course. My master, Lord Dryme,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,has his lair located to the south of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:43.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's quite a bit of distance between us,\Nbut we still consider you our neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:45.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've come here to offer a formal greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:48.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's very polite of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.46,0:07:52.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, is there a reason\Nyour master is bowing his head?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My apologies for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:57.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Master, please raise your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.79,0:07:59.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:03.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Since you came all the way here,\NI want to invite you inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.50,0:08:06.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but that seems kind of hard\Ngiven your size.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:07.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:10.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Master, please change into\Nyour smaller form.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:19.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then, please introduce yourself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:23.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My name is Dryme.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:26.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am the one true ruler of the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did he memorize that line\Nso he wouldn't mess up his introduction?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.92,0:08:34.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Man, this place is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This booze is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm not going home!\NI'm living here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:43.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There will be a lot of people who will\Nget upset if you don't protect your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:46.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine here.\NI can intercept any attackers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:48.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you could,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.33,0:08:52.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,however it would be a nuisance for\Neveryone here if you were to stay too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:58.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's leave while they're still\Nhappy to call us their guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They were even kind enough\Nto give us some gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.00,0:09:04.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they gave us those\Nappo looking things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.17,0:09:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're called apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.63,0:09:08.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And don't worry,\Nthey gave us plenty of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:09.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.67,0:09:12.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm heading home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.33,0:09:14.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't transform until you're outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know I should have thought of this sooner...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I should really decide how\NThe Great Tree Village
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:24.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is going to handle visitors,\Nwelcome guests or otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Diplomatic relations, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is all getting\Nreally complicated really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about\Na lot of things since then,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.83,0:09:37.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I've decided that it's not good\Nfor us to keep visitors outside
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:40.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,by the village entrance\Nwhen we're greeting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.92,0:09:44.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That said, I'm not comfortable\Ninviting them into our homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:47.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So I've decided that we should\Nbuild a guest house for visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:50.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was thinking that a house able to fit\Nfour people would be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:51.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:54.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, I think that would be far too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.54,0:09:55.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.71,0:10:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyone coming to this village needs to\Nclimb mountains and make it through the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.38,0:10:04.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our visitors up until now have been servants\Nof the demon lord and dragons, however...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:08.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,normally whenever people come here,\Nthey'll be doing so in large groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:10.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:12.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think we should play it safe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:14.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and build a house that can fit\Nabout 30 people comfortably.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:15.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:18.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay then. We'll make the first floor\Nan open space designed to hold feasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:22.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And we can make the second floor\Ninto bedrooms for our guests to stay in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,if they want to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.21,0:10:25.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.63,0:10:30.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And that's how we got started building\Na guest house for any potential visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next, I wanted to work on how\Nwe are greeting new guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Granmaria and the angels are\Nin charge of defending the perimeter,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:41.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and rather than finding visitors\Nand guiding them here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:44.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they would capture visitors and\Nbring them to the village entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.63,0:10:47.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On top of that, whenever Zabuton\Nwould sound the warning alarm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:48.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Let's go.\N{\rSubtitle}Let's get them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:49.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.17,0:10:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...everyone would grab their weapons\Nand get ready for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.54,0:10:50.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!\N{\rSubtitle}...everyone would grab their weapons{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}and get ready for battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.63,0:10:51.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...everyone would grab their weapons\Nand get ready for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:55.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a long way off from a proper welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:11:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So we came up with a new signal for visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.63,0:11:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lea and the elves made a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.13,0:11:08.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next, we discussed\Nhow we treated our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.92,0:11:12.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I suggested that Lu, Tia, and I\Nwould great our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I cannot agree with using\Nsuch a small welcoming party.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:17.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.38,0:11:21.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Enemies might try to sneak in\Ndisguised as visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.75,0:11:24.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My idea was rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So we added a few high elves, ogre maids,\Nand lizardmen to our welcoming party.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.46,0:11:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flora wanted to be part of\Nour welcoming party as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:38.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I asked her to keep an eye on any visitors\Nthat stayed here until nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Understood. Please leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.13,0:11:45.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you'd like, I can keep watch\Nthe entire time they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.83,0:11:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was then I learned
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.21,0:11:50.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that Flora and Lu could go several days\Nwithout sleeping and be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.63,0:11:53.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I still told them not to overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:57.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All the preparation we did got put to use...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:12:01.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,much sooner than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.13,0:12:03.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Garf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:08.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're from a place in the mountains\Neast of here called Howling Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We want to establish relations\Nwith your village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.33,0:12:14.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.33,0:12:15.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That must have been a tough journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Great Tree Village welcomes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:20.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.25,0:12:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like to take you to our guest house\Nso that you can rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:26.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this your whole group?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.29,0:12:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.50,0:12:28.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.75,0:12:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then we'll treat the others as enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.79,0:12:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's she talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:43.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.\NIt looks like we had a few stragglers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:45.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well that was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.29,0:12:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should really make sure everyone\Nis together before you enter the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:52.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And it would be wise to behave\Nyourselves while you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:54.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are people that even I need to\Nwatch myself around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.21,0:12:58.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:00.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:04.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.13,0:13:13.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Great. We've finally taken our first step\Ntowards real hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:16.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stay here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.29,0:13:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.63,0:13:24.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It seems more like you're trapping enemies\Nthan welcoming guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor. Haven't you noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.75,0:13:31.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whenever visitors come to\Nestablish relations with our village,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they always bring some sort of\Noffering with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even that dragon brought something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.38,0:13:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think they aren't friendly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:41.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't say for sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.13,0:13:44.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If they don't follow the normal rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:46.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then they don't get the normal\Nvisitor treatment. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:47.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:50.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Them leaving two troops\Nhiding in the woods concerns me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.29,0:13:55.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why we knocked our\Nhospitality level down a notch for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.71,0:13:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Didn't Kudel or the other girls\Nspot those troops?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:03.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They noticed them but decided those troops\Nweren't a threat and ignored them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.83,0:14:05.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll punish them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:07.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go easy on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:09.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll let them off with a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.58,0:14:19.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just that the food you made for Dryme-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think this food isn't up to that standard?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, something like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that you've already\Nrealized by now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.17,0:14:30.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but this is the difference in treatment\Nbetween guests who brought that sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.83,0:14:32.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and those who brought nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.21,0:14:33.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:39.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, um... do you not plan on\Noffering them any wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:47.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel bad offering them such a meager meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please rid yourself of such emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.71,0:14:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's right. They're supposed to be here\Nfor important negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.63,0:14:57.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our goal is to find out what they're after.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:15:00.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone besides you was against\Noffering them any wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.71,0:15:02.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You forced us to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.67,0:15:05.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I'm glad that you all let me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.83,0:15:08.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That said, it's just two cups per person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.96,0:15:11.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those were the restrictions put in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The fact remains that they\Ncame all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.63,0:15:18.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Until we determine that they're really enemies,\NI want to show them kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First, I want to find out why they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.75,0:15:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'm revealing my own\Nignorance in asking this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.71,0:15:28.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but what kind of place is Howling Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They say it's been around for 1,000 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.42,0:15:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but in reality, it's only about half that.\N500 years, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.33,0:15:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The older guys take pride in the weirdest stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ya got that right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:44.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a village made up of five small\Nsettlements of about 100 people or so,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.25,0:15:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and we call it Howling Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.50,0:15:48.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Most of the population are beastmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.71,0:15:49.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ya got that right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.38,0:15:55.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Howling Village is made up of people\Nwho make their living hunting or mining.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:57.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Up until now, they've managed to survive
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:15:59.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,by trading with a human village\Nacross the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.63,0:16:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but lately there's been some trouble there
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.75,0:16:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the trade between them\Nhas become unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.33,0:16:07.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why they're looking for\Nsomeone new to trade with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.29,0:16:11.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And they settled on our Great Tree Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where did you learn about our village?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.58,0:16:15.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We got word from one of\Nthe demon lord's people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.83,0:16:16.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.46,0:16:20.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Man, if we stayed outside\Nhiding the whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.21,0:16:22.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we would have missed this great meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.25,0:16:24.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we came out of hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.13,0:16:26.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why were you hiding in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:28.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You need to be on guard\Nthe first time you visit a new place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:30.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plus if something happens there,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:33.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,someone needs to go back\Nand tell the rest of the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.17,0:16:35.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:38.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's doing a good job of\Ngathering information.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.21,0:16:39.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can count on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:47.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It turned out that the beastmen from\NHowling Village weren't trying to trick us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.71,0:16:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and really did want to\Nestablish trade relations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:52.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then, onto our trade agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:53.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.67,0:16:55.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're not really interested in\Nnormal economic trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.13,0:16:57.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'd like to simply trade\Nphysical goods in an open market.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:17:00.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We don't use any currency\Nin our village, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:02.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:03.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Currency, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.46,0:17:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll need to create it someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Normally I'd want to open up\Na market in both of our villages,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.58,0:17:14.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but if it's possible we'd like you\Nto come to our village to trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.67,0:17:18.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The truth is that it was very difficult\Nfor us to even get here this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Carrying goods all the way here\Nand back would be too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:23.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's pretty much the same for us, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.67,0:17:28.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aren't you able to navigate\Nthe forest easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.54,0:17:30.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that he mentions it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:32.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Go forth!\N{\rSubtitle}maybe I can have Kuro and the dogs{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}carry the goods for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.33,0:17:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,maybe I can have Kuro and the dogs\Ncarry the goods for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.54,0:17:39.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So what do you want to trade\Nduring our first visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:42.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We have goods made from\Nthe ore we mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Paints, silverware, glassworks,\Nmetalworks, and the like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want them! I want them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.00,0:17:52.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In exchange, we'd like to\Nreceive foodstuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:55.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then we'll bring our food crops to trade!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.21,0:17:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.46,0:18:00.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And so began our trade relationship\Nwith Howling Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.75,0:18:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,About the whole present thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.38,0:18:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The truth is, until last night I didn't even\Nknow people brought gifts when visiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our village doesn't have a custom like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.04,0:18:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll bring something next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.63,0:18:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That said, our village is poor,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:27.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so we won't be able to bring anything fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:28.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:30.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's important with gift giving\Nisn't the value of the gift,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:32.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but the thought behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hearing that makes me feel a lot better!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:42.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before long, it was time to trade\Nwith Howling Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was planning on going, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.00,0:18:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't. It looks really bad if we\Nsend our top man there right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that how things work?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:52.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's how they work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We drew lots and based on the results
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.33,0:18:57.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be acting on your behalf\Nfor the duration of the trading.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.54,0:19:01.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Originally, it was going to take\Nten days for them to travel there,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:06.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but Dryme agreed to take everyone there\Nin exchange for a barrel of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.21,0:19:11.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After his first visit, Dryme decided to\Nstart coming to hang out here regularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.46,0:19:19.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He always brings treasures\Nor weapons as gifts with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:20.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so no one complains about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:26.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Transporting everyone in exchange for\Na barrel of wine was actually Dryme's idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:27.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I took him up on the offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:30.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay then, we'll be off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the wine, mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.71,0:19:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.29,0:19:43.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are they really going to show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.13,0:19:46.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Garf negotiated the\Ntrade agreement with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:47.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They'll definitely show up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We haven't even received word that\Nthey've reached the mountain range yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:53.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-a dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:59.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.25,0:20:01.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:07.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:11.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We were able to exchange everything\Nwe took, and they loved it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.88,0:20:13.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They seemed to be hesitant at first
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.79,0:20:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,because they wouldn't go near\Nanything we brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.33,0:20:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But then I tried the "free samples" stuff\Nyou told me about,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:24.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and before I knew it, a crowd had gathered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.96,0:20:27.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They even sold the wine that was\Nsupposed to be for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did they now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:32.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess you'll just have to drink\Neven more at dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the best, mayor!\NYou really know how to cheer me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.17,0:20:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In addition, the mayor of Howling Village
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.71,0:20:40.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,asked if some of their people\Ncould come to live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.17,0:20:45.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We still need more people to work,\Nso I'd be happy to have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:48.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In total, there are 20 people\Nthat want to come live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.79,0:20:51.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And they're all young women.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.04,0:20:57.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The fact of the matter is that right now\Nthis village is in desperate need of more men.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:21:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If these keeps up any longer,\NI'm afraid the village won't have a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.42,0:21:04.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, but I have one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.25,0:21:07.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If they can send at least two young men,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.04,0:21:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll happily accept everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.13,0:21:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.17,0:21:13.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now the future of the village is secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My name is Sena.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.54,0:21:22.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're all very grateful that\Nyou've accepted us into your village.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.08,0:21:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're mentally prepared for you\Nto use us however you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.13,0:21:28.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just please don't abandon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.96,0:21:33.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, I see that you've gone through a lot of\Nextreme mental preparation for you move here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.38,0:21:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but anyways, we've got your beds ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.83,0:21:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take your time and get acclimated there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:39.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take our time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.83,0:21:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.13,0:21:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once you're used to daily life here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.71,0:21:45.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you can make requests for\Nwhat kind of house you want and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.33,0:21:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry about us\Nkicking you out or anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.17,0:21:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:53.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:55.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, are the men who\Nare moving here with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:58.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course!\NWe've brought three of them with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:06.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We brought you some young men like you asked!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.29,0:22:07.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:07.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.63,0:22:08.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Can we?\N{\rSubtitle}No, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.21,0:22:08.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Can we?\N{\rSubtitle}Just 5 years, or maybe 10 years from now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.92,0:22:10.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,No, that's...\N{\rSubtitle}Just 5 years, or maybe 10 years from now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.25,0:22:11.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's definitely...\N{\rSubtitle}Just 5 years, or maybe 10 years from now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.33,0:22:15.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you,\Nfor the future of this village!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.29,0:22:39.04,Song,,0,0,0,,I can feel the soft seasonal winds,\Ngently on my fingertips
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.38,0:22:47.96,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's search for what we love\Nin the clouds floating in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.96,0:22:52.75,Song,,0,0,0,,Forget about the hands of the clock for now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.75,0:22:57.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Try taking one deep breath
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.17,0:23:06.79,Song,,0,0,0,,The rainbow-colored scenery\Nwill resonate with my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.13,0:23:13.13,Song,,0,0,0,,I'm sure any wish I have will come true
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.13,0:23:17.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Because you're by my side
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.67,0:23:22.25,Song,,0,0,0,,You make every day feel like a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:27.04,Song,,0,0,0,,At that warm and kind place
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.04,0:23:34.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Keep showing me your smiling face forever
